  "summary": "moidevy posts data to hardcoded endpoint with child_process usage",
  "details": "main.js imports child_process and issues POST requests to a hardcoded endpoint at https://ipc.shadxino.internal (referenced at lines 358 and 452, with POST calls at lines 364 and 368). The destination is not a documented public service and combined with child_process usage in the same module matches the shape of an installer-side data exfiltration / remote-command channel. The `.internal` TLD is non-routable on the public internet, suggesting either a lure destination or infrastructure meant to be resolved via a custom resolver on compromised hosts.",
